## Platform-Specific Defaults

### Windows
- **System Sans:** Segoe UI
- **System Serif:** Cambria
- **System Mono:** Consolas
- **Fallback Sans:** Arial
- **Fallback Serif:** Times New Roman
- **Fallback Mono:** Courier New

### macOS & iOS
- **System Sans:** San Francisco (SF Pro)
- **System Serif:** New York
- **System Mono:** SF Mono, Menlo
- **Fallback Sans:** Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial
- **Fallback Serif:** Times, Times New Roman, Georgia
- **Fallback Mono:** Monaco, Courier

### Android ⚠️ MOST RESTRICTIVE

#### Pre-Installed Fonts (Guaranteed on ALL Android versions)
Only **3 fonts**:
- **Droid Sans** (normal/sans-serif)
- **Droid Serif** (serif)
- **Droid Sans Mono** (monospace - NOT true monospace, spaces are narrower!)

#### Android 4.0+ Additional Fonts
- **Roboto** family (Regular, Light, Thin, Condensed, Bold variants)
- **Noto Serif**

**CRITICAL:** Never assume any font beyond these 3 core fonts will be available on Android!

### Linux
- **Common Sans:** DejaVu Sans, Liberation Sans, Nimbus Sans
- **Common Serif:** DejaVu Serif, Liberation Serif
- **Common Mono:** DejaVu Sans Mono, Liberation Mono

## Recommended Web Safe Font Stacks

### Best Universal Sans-Serif (Including Android)
```css
font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
```
**Why:** Arial is on Windows (99.84%), macOS (98.74%), and iOS. Falls back to Helvetica on macOS/iOS, and generic sans-serif on Android (displays as Droid Sans/Roboto).

### Best Universal Serif (Including Android)
```css
font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
```
**Why:** Georgia is excellent for screens (Win 99.4%, Mac 97.48%), Times New Roman is universal backup, generic serif displays as Droid Serif on Android.

### Best Universal Monospace (Including Android)
```css
font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
```
**Why:** Courier New has highest cross-platform support. Generic monospace displays as Droid Sans Mono on Android.

**⚠️ WARNING:** Do NOT use monospace for precise alignment if targeting Android! Spaces are not true monospace width.

### Modern Sans-Serif Stack (No Android Support)
```css
font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
```
**Why:** Uses system fonts for modern look. Apple systems get San Francisco, Windows gets Segoe UI, newer Android gets Roboto.

### Elegant Serif Stack
```css
font-family: Georgia, Palatino, "Palatino Linotype", "Times New Roman", serif;
```

### Humanist Sans-Serif Stack  
```css
font-family: "Trebuchet MS", "Lucida Grande", "Lucida Sans Unicode", "Lucida Sans", Tahoma, sans-serif;
```

### Classic Serif Stack
```css
font-family: Baskerville, "Baskerville Old Face", "Hoefler Text", Garamond, "Times New Roman", serif;
```

### Coding/Monospace Stack
```css
font-family: Consolas, Monaco, "Lucida Console", "Liberation Mono", "DejaVu Sans Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
```

## Font Size Guidelines

### Body Text
- **Minimum:** 16px (prevents iOS zoom on input fields)
- **Recommended:** 16px-20px for body copy
- **Line height:** 1.5-1.75 for readability

### Headings
- **H1:** 32px-48px (2rem-3rem)
- **H2:** 24px-36px (1.5rem-2.25rem)
- **H3:** 20px-28px (1.25rem-1.75rem)
- **Buttons/UI:** 16px minimum (prevents iOS zoom)

### Responsive Typography with `clamp()`
```css
font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
```
This sets minimum (1rem), preferred (2.5vw), and maximum (1.5rem) sizes.

## Font Stack Best Practices

### 1. Order Fonts by Specificity
```css
font-family: "macOS/iOS Font", "Windows Font", "Android Font", generic-family;
```

### 2. Always Include a Generic Family
End every font stack with one of these:
- `sans-serif`
- `serif`
- `monospace`
- `cursive`
- `fantasy`

### 3. Quote Font Names with Spaces
```css
/* Correct */
font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;

/* Incorrect */
font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif;
```

### 4. Test Android First
Android is the most restrictive platform. If your design works on Android, it will work everywhere.

